meta {
  name: Generate phrase cards
  type: http
  seq: 56
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/trips/{{tripId}}/phrase-cards
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrfToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "language": "ja",
    "preferences": ["vegetarian", "no peanuts"]
  }
}

docs {
  Generates the cards of one language once (201 `PhraseCards`) through the
  LLM: greetings, a reservation card with the `{name}` placeholder, one
  address card per lodging of the trip, food (from `preferences`),
  emergency, numbers and prices. 409 `E_CONFLICT` with the existing `id`
  unless `?force=true`; 402 `E_LLM_QUOTA_EXCEEDED` over the monthly cap;
  503 `E_LLM_UNAVAILABLE`; 422 `E_LLM_BAD_OUTPUT` after one retry.
}
